Login screen had JavaScript errors preventing proper redirection after authentication. Investigation revealed syntax error in assignment and incorrect path resolution.

## Changes

- **Fixed duplicate assignment in `cliente.js`**: Removed redundant `window.location.href =` causing syntax error on admin login redirect
  ```javascript
  // Before
  window.location.href = window.location.href = "admin.html";

  // After
  window.location.href = "admin.html";
  ```

- **Corrected dashboard path**: Changed absolute path to relative since code executes from `/servicos/area_do_cliente/`
  ```javascript
  // Before
  const basePath = 'servicos/area_do_cliente/dashboard.html';

  // After
  const basePath = 'dashboard.html';
  ```

- **Added missing `isPlanActive` property in `Register.tsx`**: Registration flow was creating user objects without this property, causing undefined behavior in plan activation checks. Now explicitly sets `isPlanActive: false` to match Login flow.

## Screenshot

![Login page rendering correctly](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a002a60a-3cb2-47d9-a8d1-f7c13882e5d8)

